==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Puffington]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Rush the first Mr. Puffington with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]]. Then do your usual stack of Anti-Metal CCs and Critters, Metal Cyclone shouldn't posses any threat at this point of the game, considering how low-effort this stage is.
[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master/Esoteric Uril]] can put the other two Puffingtons in their place and units like [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], Masked [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Grandmaster Cat]], and/or [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] can finish them off conveniently.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Lufalan Pasalan]]: With enough luck, he can one-shot the Metal Cyclone.

