==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Groundscraper|groundscraper]] is a large, long and low building, essentially the horizontal equivalent of a skyscraper.
**Groundscraper may also refer to [[Metal Cyclone]], which constantly scrapes the ground due to its inability to float.
*Based on the theming of [[Konjac Valley]], Groundscraper's Japanese name, Micro Highrise Building, may refer to the technology company [[wikipedia:Microsoft|Microsoft]].
*Along with [[Meandering Road]], Groundscraper appears to have been designed specifically for [[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kaguya]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] alongside Konjac Valley. Ultra Kaguya gains Metal Killer, allowing her to eliminate the Metal Cyclone before the second Mr. Puffington even has a chance to spawn.

